<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman initiates Merita.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman initiates Merita.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Monday it had initiated coverage of Finnish banking group Merita Oy as a &quot;market outperformer&quot;.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
